# SafetyNet API — Integration & Architecture Guide

SafetyNet API is a Spring Boot backend application designed for real-time community crime reporting, AI-powered incident classification, and identity management. It integrates **WhatsApp API (via Twilio)** for citizen reporting, **Google Gemini AI** for intelligent text analysis and PII redaction, and **Google OAuth API** for identity management.

---

## 🏗️ System Architecture Overview

```mermaid
flowchart TD
    Citizen([Citizen on WhatsApp]) -->|1. Incoming Message| Twilio[Twilio WhatsApp Gateway]
    Twilio -->|2. HTTP POST /webhook/whatsapp| API[TwilioWebhookController]
    
    API -->|3. State Machine & Session| Service[IncidentService]
    Service -->|4. Redact PII & Extract Patterns| Gemini[Gemini AI API]
    
    Service -->|5. Store Anonymized Report| DB[(PostgreSQL + PostGIS)]
    Service -->|6. Real-time STOMP Broadcast| WS[WebSocket Broker /topic/incidents]
    WS -->|7. Live Alert| Dashboard[CPF Dashboard UI]
    
    Service -->|8. TwiML Response| Twilio
    Twilio -->|9. Reply Message| Citizen

    User([CPF Officer / Admin]) -->|Google SSO Login| Auth[AuthController /api/auth/google-login]
    Auth -->|Check Google Sub / Link Account| DB
```

---

## 🔌 Key API Integrations

### 1. WhatsApp Integration (Twilio Webhooks)

- **Source Code**: [`TwilioWebhookController.java`](file:///c:/Users/Tumi/Downloads/Crime/safetynet/safetynet-api/src/main/java/com/safetynet/safetynet_api/controller/TwilioWebhookController.java) | [`IncidentService.java`](file:///c:/Users/Tumi/Downloads/Crime/safetynet/safetynet-api/src/main/java/com/safetynet/safetynet_api/service/IncidentService.java)
- **Endpoint**: `POST /webhook/whatsapp`
- **Content Type**: `application/x-www-form-urlencoded`

#### Features & Workflow:
1. **Signature Security**: Validates the `X-Twilio-Signature` HTTP header using Twilio's `RequestValidator` and the configured `TWILIO_AUTH_TOKEN` to ensure requests originate exclusively from Twilio.
2. **Stateful Conversation Engine**: Maintains an in-memory session state machine per phone number:
   - `AWAITING_ANONYMITY`: Asks the user if they wish to remain anonymous (`yes` / `no`).
   - `AWAITING_REPORT_DETAILS`: Captures raw incident description.
   - `AWAITING_IMAGES`: Prompts for incident media uploads.
3. **Automated TwiML Formatting**: Generates TwiML XML payloads (`<Response><Message>...</Message></Response>`) returned to Twilio to reply dynamically to the WhatsApp user.

---

### 2. Gemini AI Integration (Google Generative AI)

- **Source Code**: [`GeminiAIService.java`](file:///c:/Users/Tumi/Downloads/Crime/safetynet/safetynet-api/src/main/java/com/safetynet/safetynet_api/service/GeminiAIService.java)
- **Model Endpoint**: `gemini-1.5-flash` (`https://generativelanguage.googleapis.com/v1beta/models/gemini-1.5-flash:generateContent`)

#### AI Processing Pipeline:

| Task | Method | Description |
| :--- | :--- | :--- |
| **PII Redaction** | `redactPII()` | Removes names, phone numbers, SA ID numbers, and street addresses, replacing them with `[REDACTED]`. |
| **Pattern Extraction** | `extractPattern()` | Uses `responseMimeType: application/json` to extract `crime_type`, `infrastructure_target`, `severity` (1–5 scale), `keywords`, and `estimated_time`. |
| **Urgency Scoring** | `scoreUrgency()` | Analyzes natural language cues (e.g., *"armed"*, *"shots fired"*, *"ongoing"*) to rate urgency on a 1–10 scale. |
| **Report Parsing** | `extractReportDetails()` | Parses reporter details while respecting user anonymity preferences. |

---

### 3. Google OAuth & Identity Integration

- **Source Code**: [`AuthController.java`](file:///c:/Users/Tumi/Downloads/Crime/safetynet/safetynet-api/src/main/java/com/safetynet/safetynet_api/controller/AuthController.java)
- **Endpoint**: `POST /api/auth/google-login`

#### Authentication Flow:
1. **SSO Payload**: Receives [`GoogleLoginRequestDTO`](file:///c:/Users/Tumi/Downloads/Crime/safetynet/safetynet-api/src/main/java/com/safetynet/safetynet_api/dto/GoogleLoginRequestDTO.java) containing `googleSub`, `email`, `name`, and `picture`.
2. **Account Linking**: Searches PostgreSQL for matching `googleSub` or `email`.
   - **Existing User**: Authenticates user and links `googleSub` if missing.
   - **New User**: Returns `registered: false`, triggering mandatory WhatsApp number verification before finalizing registration.

---

## ⚙️ Environment Configuration

Set the following environment variables in `.env` or system environment:

```env
# Twilio WhatsApp Configuration
TWILIO_AUTH_TOKEN=your_twilio_auth_token
TWILIO_VALIDATION_ENABLED=true

# Google Gemini AI Configuration
GEMINI_API_KEY=your_gemini_api_key
GEMINI_MODEL=gemini-1.5-flash

# Database Configuration
SPRING_DATASOURCE_URL=jdbc:postgresql://localhost:5432/safetynet
SPRING_DATASOURCE_USERNAME=postgres
SPRING_DATASOURCE_PASSWORD=your_password
```

---

## 🚀 Running the API

```bash
# Build the application
./mvnw clean package -DskipTests

# Run locally
./mvnw spring-boot:run
```
